{"sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","items":[{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k001","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"1차원 등가속도 운동에서 v=v₀+at, x=x₀+v₀t+at²/2, v²=v₀²+2aΔx를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k002","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"Newton 법칙 ΣF=ma에서 자유물체도를 그려 각 방향 힘을 분해한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k003","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"운동마찰력 f_k=μ_kN, 정지마찰력은 최대 μ_sN 이하이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k004","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"일 W=∫F·dr이며 순일은 운동에너지 변화다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k005","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"보존력이 하는 일은 퍼텐셜 에너지 감소와 같다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k006","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"중력 근사 U=mgh, 용수철 U=kx²/2이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k007","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"운동량 p=mv, 충격량 J=∫Fdt=Δp이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k008","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"외력이 없는 계의 총운동량은 보존된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k009","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"탄성충돌은 운동에너지도 보존한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k010","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"원운동의 구심가속도 a=v²/r=ω²r이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k011","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"강체 회전에서 τ=Iα, L=Iω, Krot=Iω²/2(고정축 조건)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k012","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"단순조화운동에서 x=Acos(ωt+φ), 질량-용수철 ω=√(k/m), 작은각 단진자 ω≈√(g/L)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k013","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"외력이 없는 계에서 운동량 보존.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k014","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"구심력은 별도의 새로운 힘이 아니라 알짜힘의 반지름 방향 성분.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k015","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"탄성충돌과 비탄성충돌의 운동에너지 보존 여부를 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k016","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"토크는 기준점 선택에 의존한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-mechanics--motion-k017","sectionId":"physics-mechanics/motion","unitId":"physics-mechanics","subject":"physics","text":"절반이 된다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]}]}